WEBVTT

02:35.864 --> 02:37.615
The reason I won...

02:38.408 --> 02:41.244
was because I could pick up the scent
of a thread to an opening.

02:44.455 --> 02:46.416
When I fight someone,

02:46.833 --> 02:50.044
I just need to pick up his scent
to see the thread.

02:53.339 --> 02:56.634
The thread would lead my blade
to my opponent's weak spot.

02:56.926 --> 02:59.220
The moment I saw the thread,
it became tighter.

03:06.436 --> 03:08.730
It strongly pulled my blade

03:09.188 --> 03:10.690
towards my opponent's weak spot.

03:32.337 --> 03:33.671
Master Urokodaki.

03:37.091 --> 03:41.888
I didn't plan to allow you
to take part in the Final Selection.

03:44.224 --> 03:47.518
Because I don't want to see
another child gets killed doing it.

03:48.728 --> 03:52.649
I didn't believe
that you can cut the rock.

03:57.946 --> 03:59.781
You've worked hard.

04:00.365 --> 04:04.702
Tanjiro, you are an amazing kid.

04:12.752 --> 04:16.214
Promise me that you'll survive
the Final Selection.

04:16.631 --> 04:19.008
Your sister and I will be here
to wait for your return.

04:32.146 --> 04:34.440
What's the occasion? These look delicious.

04:35.149 --> 04:37.860
I'm doing all this
to celebrate your graduation.

04:38.236 --> 04:40.280
Don't mention it, just eat.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.324
Thank you, Master.

04:48.413 --> 04:49.580
Tanjiro,

04:50.373 --> 04:53.251
I have done everything I could for you.

04:53.751 --> 04:58.339
What you're going to face next
is different from what you've trained for.

04:58.423 --> 05:00.758
Those will be times of turbulence.

05:01.759 --> 05:03.928
So at least for now,

05:04.262 --> 05:07.890
keep your mind at ease
and take a good rest.

05:23.823 --> 05:25.575
Well, Tanjiro.

05:27.577 --> 05:28.536
Yes?

05:29.662 --> 05:31.456
Did you like my hot pot?

05:32.040 --> 05:33.041
Yes.

05:33.124 --> 05:35.335
I haven't tasted anything so delicious
in a long time.

05:36.586 --> 05:40.423
For a kid with a huge appetite like you,
a good meal will earn you some energy

05:40.506 --> 05:42.216
and a few inches in height.

05:42.842 --> 05:45.428
But the same goes for the demons.

05:46.429 --> 05:47.680
So bear this in mind.

05:48.056 --> 05:51.809
Basically, a demon's strength
is based on how many people they eat.

05:52.810 --> 05:55.813
So the more people they eat,
the stronger they become?

05:56.898 --> 05:57.899
That's right.

05:58.274 --> 05:59.609
As it gains strength,

05:59.692 --> 06:03.863
a demon experiences bodily changes
and may even gain magical powers.

06:10.161 --> 06:13.331
If your sense of smell is keen enough,

06:13.414 --> 06:16.125
you can even smell
how many people a demon has eaten.

06:19.378 --> 06:20.338
What is this?

06:21.756 --> 06:23.925
It's called a talisman mask.

06:24.133 --> 06:26.636
It is to keep you away from calamity.

06:26.719 --> 06:28.596
I've cast it with a spell.

06:29.722 --> 06:31.349
A talisman mask.

07:01.295 --> 07:02.338
Nezuko.

07:09.679 --> 07:12.807
I promise that I'll come back to you.

07:15.435 --> 07:17.478
Don't worry about your sister.

07:17.812 --> 07:19.939
I can look after her.

07:20.481 --> 07:21.482
Yes.

07:21.649 --> 07:22.859
Thank you, Master.

07:25.778 --> 07:28.197
I'll get going, Master Urokodaki.

07:34.078 --> 07:36.247
Say hello to Sabito and Makomo for me.

07:38.458 --> 07:39.625
Tanjiro.

07:40.084 --> 07:41.419
How did you...

07:42.336 --> 07:44.922
know the names of those dead kids?

07:56.642 --> 07:57.894
Nice.

07:58.060 --> 07:59.520
This is a lot of wisteria.

08:00.771 --> 08:02.815
But it's not blooming season.

08:34.931 --> 08:36.599
There are so many people.

08:38.434 --> 08:39.977
-Dearest participants,
-Dearest participants,

08:40.061 --> 08:43.064
-thank you for gathering here to join
-thank you for gathering here to join

08:43.147 --> 08:46.817
-the Demon Slayer Corps's Final Selection.
-the Demon Slayer Corps's Final Selection.

08:47.527 --> 08:49.654
Here on Fujikasane Mountain,

08:49.737 --> 08:53.866
we have in captivity a lot of demons
caught alive by our very own slayers.

08:54.242 --> 08:56.369
There is no way they can get out of here.

08:57.245 --> 09:02.583
That is because wisteria blossoms
which demons fear the most

09:02.667 --> 09:06.212
bloom all year from the hillside
to the foot of the mountain.

09:07.046 --> 09:09.090
But from this point onward,

09:09.173 --> 09:11.676
there will be no wisteria blossoms,

09:11.759 --> 09:13.344
so demons may appear.

09:13.928 --> 09:16.597
If you can survive in this place
for seven days,

09:17.014 --> 09:21.060
you are qualified for the Final Selection.

09:22.478 --> 09:25.356
-Thus, we wish you all the best.
-Thus, we wish you all the best.

09:40.329 --> 09:41.330
Seven days?

09:41.706 --> 09:43.708
I just have to know how to survive.

09:47.253 --> 09:49.338
First, I have to live through tonight.

09:49.964 --> 09:52.925
After sunrise tomorrow,
the demons won't show up.

09:53.175 --> 09:55.052
That will give me a good rest.

09:55.761 --> 09:57.430
For that, I need to head east.

09:58.598 --> 10:01.058
I need to head towards
where the sun rises the earliest.

10:05.938 --> 10:06.939
This scent...

10:07.106 --> 10:09.275
A demon is really close.

10:17.950 --> 10:18.951
Where is it?

10:19.368 --> 10:20.620
Where will it come from?

10:20.828 --> 10:22.747
I can't tell where the scent
is coming from.

10:23.914 --> 10:24.915
It's from above!

10:35.301 --> 10:36.260
Demon.

10:42.391 --> 10:43.517
You bastard!

10:45.436 --> 10:48.064
Keep your hands off my food.

10:48.147 --> 10:49.482
Now get out of here.

10:49.565 --> 10:51.776
Who cares? How about you get out of here?

10:52.026 --> 10:53.486
Two demons have shown up at once.

10:53.903 --> 10:55.404
Is there a way to deal with them?

10:55.613 --> 10:57.239
That's my prey, damn it!

10:57.323 --> 10:58.366
Shut up!

10:58.449 --> 11:00.785
First come, first serve!

11:07.208 --> 11:08.292
It's okay.

11:08.417 --> 11:09.919
Keep calm and observe them.

11:10.252 --> 11:12.046
Think about your training.

11:12.338 --> 11:15.091
It has been a while
since I last had human meat.

11:15.174 --> 11:16.300
Total Concentration Breathing.

11:16.467 --> 11:17.676
Breath of Water.

11:23.057 --> 11:24.392
It's the scent of a thread.

11:27.978 --> 11:29.021
Fourth Form,

11:30.398 --> 11:31.399
Striking Tide!

11:41.283 --> 11:42.535
I slew them.

11:44.745 --> 11:46.330
I defeated demons.

11:47.206 --> 11:48.499
I'm getting stronger.

11:49.417 --> 11:51.502
All my days of hard work
haven't gone to waste.

11:52.169 --> 11:53.754
I've grasped everything.

12:01.637 --> 12:04.765
When beheaded with the sword
Master Urokodaki bestowed to me,

12:05.182 --> 12:06.892
the demon gets obliterated, doesn't it?

12:10.020 --> 12:12.106
The demon's vital part is its neck.

12:12.398 --> 12:15.526
But if you cut it with an ordinary sword,

12:15.609 --> 12:17.278
it won't kill the demon.

12:17.778 --> 12:20.531
So what should I do to defeat a demon?

12:21.031 --> 12:25.578
A Demon Slayer Corps sword
is made out of a special kind of steel.

12:25.744 --> 12:28.539
It's the only weapon that can slay demons.

12:29.790 --> 12:33.252
It's called a Nichirin Blade.

12:40.759 --> 12:42.219
May you be reborn as human beings.

12:47.016 --> 12:49.894
Now, where is this stench coming from?

12:51.729 --> 12:54.857
Nobody told me
that something like this will happen!

12:55.232 --> 12:56.233
What's happening?

13:09.079 --> 13:11.290
What on earth is that?

13:14.627 --> 13:16.003
Hey, Sabito.

13:17.671 --> 13:20.508
Do you think Tanjiro can beat him?

13:22.593 --> 13:23.761
Beats me.

13:24.261 --> 13:27.473
No matter how hard you try,
it won't be enough.

13:28.807 --> 13:30.059
You should know it.

13:30.309 --> 13:31.602
So you will...

13:37.650 --> 13:40.152
Why does it have to be so damn big?

13:40.236 --> 13:41.862
No one told me about this beast.

14:00.589 --> 14:01.590
It has eaten him.

14:27.575 --> 14:28.701
Don't be scared.

14:28.951 --> 14:31.453
I have to save him!

14:31.662 --> 14:33.706
I'm no longer the helpless kid
I used to be.

14:34.206 --> 14:35.249
Now, go!

14:36.458 --> 14:38.919
Breath of Water, Second Form,

14:39.003 --> 14:40.129
Water Wheel!

14:49.597 --> 14:51.098
You're back.

14:51.265 --> 14:53.809
My cute little fox.

14:54.351 --> 14:55.394
"Back"?

14:56.270 --> 15:00.566
My dear little fox,
what year of the Meiji era is it?

15:01.901 --> 15:03.736
It's now the Taisho era.

15:04.403 --> 15:06.947
Taisho?

15:11.952 --> 15:13.871
It's a new era!

15:14.038 --> 15:16.832
You changed to a new era!

15:16.916 --> 15:17.875
You changed it.

15:17.958 --> 15:21.879
You changed it when I'm trapped
in this goddamn place!

15:23.047 --> 15:24.381
I can't let this happen!

15:24.465 --> 15:26.425
I'll never ever forgive you for this!

15:26.592 --> 15:31.347
Damn you, Urokodaki!

15:31.430 --> 15:33.015
How do you know Master Urokodaki?

15:33.515 --> 15:34.892
Of course I do.

15:34.975 --> 15:37.978
It was him who brought me here.

15:38.062 --> 15:40.814
I'll never forget what happened
47 years ago.

15:41.565 --> 15:47.279
That bastard was a demon hunter
in the Edo period, the Keio era.

15:47.488 --> 15:49.615
A demon hunter in the Edo period?

15:49.782 --> 15:50.824
You're a liar!

15:51.033 --> 15:53.702
There's no demon that could live so long.

15:53.869 --> 15:57.915
Only demons who ate three people
are held in captivity here.

15:58.248 --> 16:02.836
Such are the demons that were slain
and also those who killed each other.

16:03.629 --> 16:06.799
But I've been alive and kicking
all this while.

16:07.466 --> 16:09.718
As I waited behind bars of wisteria,

16:09.802 --> 16:13.347
I had eaten a total of 50 people,
you brats.

16:13.889 --> 16:15.307
Fifty people?

16:15.933 --> 16:17.476
Eleven.

16:17.726 --> 16:19.061
Twelve.

16:19.311 --> 16:20.980
Thirteen.

16:22.147 --> 16:24.775
You are the fourteenth.

16:24.942 --> 16:26.485
What are you talking about?

16:28.153 --> 16:31.240
It's the number of Urokodaki's disciples
that I have devoured.

16:32.908 --> 16:36.704
It has been my resolution
to gobble up every kid he has taught.

16:38.080 --> 16:39.373
By the way,

16:39.456 --> 16:42.918
there were two of them
who left me a great impression.

16:43.627 --> 16:47.256
One of them was a rascal
of a rare hair color.

16:47.339 --> 16:49.008
He was the strongest.

16:49.091 --> 16:51.176
His hair was peach in color.

16:51.343 --> 16:52.928
There was a scar on his cheek.

16:53.637 --> 16:57.307
The other one was a little girl
in a flowery kimono.

16:57.725 --> 17:01.478
She was a petite of little strength,
but she was a pretty quick mover.

17:03.480 --> 17:05.816
They were killed by this demon?

17:06.316 --> 17:08.444
But I saw them...

17:08.527 --> 17:11.530
That mask is a mark.

17:11.613 --> 17:13.615
That fox mask is their souvenir.

17:14.241 --> 17:18.203
I remember every fine line
of every mask that Urokodaki crafted.

17:18.829 --> 17:22.332
It's carved the exact same
as the tengu mask he wore.

17:23.042 --> 17:25.461
He said it's a talisman mask, right?

17:25.544 --> 17:28.505
I've gobbled up every single person
that wore that kind of mask.

17:28.589 --> 17:30.549
They're all in my tummy now.

17:30.632 --> 17:33.552
It's as if Urokodaki
sent them all to their deaths.

17:35.637 --> 17:36.972
The one time I said this,

17:37.056 --> 17:40.142
the little girl got so mad
that she cried like a baby.

17:41.977 --> 17:46.023
But soon after,
she started rocking and tugging at me.

17:47.649 --> 17:50.819
So I tore off her limbs and...

17:57.785 --> 17:59.203
Calm down, Tanjiro.

17:59.953 --> 18:01.538
Your breath is all over the place.

18:02.206 --> 18:05.084
It's okay.
You don't have to think about us.

18:17.429 --> 18:20.015
While he eats that kid,
I got to run for it.

18:31.485 --> 18:34.321
Another Urokodaki brat bites the dust.

18:36.573 --> 18:40.369
Now that this disciple of his
is not going to come back alive,

18:40.452 --> 18:42.121
I wonder what he thinks about this?

18:42.204 --> 18:44.498
I wonder how he feels about this?

18:46.708 --> 18:48.961
I'm so curious.

18:49.086 --> 18:50.921
I really want to know.

18:53.465 --> 18:54.716
Tanjiro.

18:55.592 --> 18:56.677
Tanjiro.

18:58.220 --> 18:59.429
Tanjiro!

19:02.141 --> 19:03.308
He dodged.

19:03.517 --> 19:05.144
He can still move.

19:05.644 --> 19:07.813
This is going to be a lot of fun.

19:15.070 --> 19:16.113
Damn.

19:16.280 --> 19:19.366
I slashed him so much,
yet he grew back his hands so quickly.

19:19.950 --> 19:23.287
You can't kill me
just by slashing my hands.

19:23.871 --> 19:29.042
To be honest, even that peachy brat
couldn't get his blade past my neck.

19:39.928 --> 19:42.681
I can't let this freak get away with it.

19:43.223 --> 19:45.726
Before he gobbles up anyone else,

19:46.602 --> 19:48.937
I must vanquish him here right now!

19:53.233 --> 19:55.444
I smell a demon from the ground.

20:00.407 --> 20:01.867
He jumped so high.

20:01.950 --> 20:03.452
I can't give him my killer blow.

20:04.119 --> 20:08.332
But being in the air doesn't protect you
from this catch!

20:10.209 --> 20:13.003
So even Tanjiro can't defeat him.

20:13.754 --> 20:16.423
That demon's neck is really hard.

20:18.091 --> 20:20.886
We have no idea of the outcome.

20:21.803 --> 20:25.641
But out of all this,
one thing is for sure.

20:27.643 --> 20:28.852
Tanjiro

20:29.978 --> 20:34.858
is someone who can hack
the biggest and hardest rock into two.

20:39.821 --> 20:40.906
He made me stretch my arm.

20:43.909 --> 20:45.160
Total Concentration Breathing.

20:45.535 --> 20:46.745
Breath of Water.

20:52.209 --> 20:54.044
He stretched me out.

20:54.920 --> 20:56.088
It doesn't matter.

20:56.171 --> 20:59.091
My neck is so hard,
he can't possibly slash it.

20:59.216 --> 21:00.342
First Form...

21:00.926 --> 21:02.636
As you fail to slash my neck,

21:02.719 --> 21:07.391
I'll squeeze your head until it bursts
just like the other brats!

21:17.359 --> 21:18.694
Water Surface Slash!

22:53.288 --> 22:54.498
Water Surface Slash!

22:54.623 --> 22:55.791
Did you like it, Nezuko?

22:55.874 --> 22:57.417
That was graceful, wasn't it?

22:59.711 --> 23:02.130
What? Sabito is better than me?

23:02.214 --> 23:04.174
No way, Nezuko.

23:05.383 --> 23:06.802
By the way,

23:06.885 --> 23:08.428
around the exam venue,

23:08.512 --> 23:11.348
there are a lot of
beautiful wisteria blossoms.

23:11.431 --> 23:13.350
Let's go see them
after you turn back into a human.

23:14.518 --> 23:17.312
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:17.729 --> 23:21.066
There's this blond guy named Zenitsu
who hated to join the Final Selection.

23:21.149 --> 23:24.111
But it took quite a few spankings
from his master to get him in there.

23:24.486 --> 23:26.947
Next, episode 5, "My Own Steel."

23:27.030 --> 23:28.156
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.240 --> 23:29.407
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
